{#
 # Kiveto — templates/components/layout/search_modal.html.twig
 # ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 # « Centre de recherche » — the v-topbar search palette (`.veil` / `.srch`),
 # opened by the topbar search button or ⌘K. Results come live from the
 # clinic search (clinic_search, format=palette); the kinds of record the
 # search does not index yet keep their pill, inert.
 #}
<div class="veil" id="veil" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="srchTitre" data-search-url="{{ path('clinic_search') }}">
  <div class="srch">
    <div class="srch-titlebar">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m13 13.5 2-2.5-2-2.5"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/><path d="M9 8.5 7 11l2 2.5"/><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/></svg>
      <h2 id="srchTitre">Centre de recherche</h2>
      <span class="srch-badge">Bêta</span>
      <button type="button" class="srch-close" id="srchClose" aria-label="Fermer"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18"/><path d="m6 6 12 12"/></svg></button>
    </div>
    <div class="srch-inwrap">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"/><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/></svg>
      <input type="search" class="srch-input" id="palInput" placeholder="Rechercher un client, un animal, un document, un RDV…" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
    </div>
    <div class="srch-pills" role="tablist" aria-label="Filtrer par type">
      <button type="button" class="srch-pill is-active" data-type="all" role="tab" aria-selected="true"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"/><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"/><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"/></svg><span>Tout</span></button>
      <button type="button" class="srch-pill" data-type="client" role="tab" aria-selected="false"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/></svg><span>Clients</span></button>
      <button type="button" class="srch-pill" data-type="animal" role="tab" aria-selected="false"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="4" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="8" r="2"/><circle cx="20" cy="16" r="2"/><path d="M9 10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v3.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-6.84 1.045Q6.52 17.48 4.46 16.84A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 5.5 10Z"/></svg><span>Animaux</span></button>
      <button type="button" class="srch-pill" data-type="document" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-disabled="true" data-toast="Recherche dans les documents — bientôt disponible"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"/><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"/><path d="M10 9H8"/><path d="M16 13H8"/><path d="M16 17H8"/></svg><span>Documents</span></button>
      <button type="button" class="srch-pill" data-type="rdv" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-disabled="true" data-toast="Recherche dans les rendez-vous — bientôt disponible"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 2v4"/><path d="M16 2v4"/><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="M3 10h18"/></svg><span>RDV</span></button>
      <button type="button" class="srch-pill" data-type="consultation" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-disabled="true" data-toast="Recherche dans les consultations — bientôt disponible"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M11 2v2"/><path d="M5 2v2"/><path d="M5 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1"/><path d="M8 15a6 6 0 0 0 12 0v-3"/><circle cx="20" cy="10" r="2"/></svg><span>Consultations</span></button>
    </div>
    <div class="srch-body">
      <div class="srch-hint" id="srchHint">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"/><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/></svg>
        <b>Que cherchez-vous ?</b>
        <span>Un nom de client, un animal, un n° de puce… dès 2 caractères.</span>
      </div>
      <div id="srchResults" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="srch-foot">
      <span>Centre de recherche Kiveto</span>
      <button type="button" class="fermer" id="srchFermer">Fermer</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
